[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15542.95, "timestamp": "04:19:02", "text": "我以前做播客，也玩虚拟世界。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15546.95, "timestamp": "04:19:06", "text": "有了虚拟现实、喵喵声以及所有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15550.229, "timestamp": "04:19:10", "text": "有点难，因为……我当时不在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15553.349, "timestamp": "04:19:13", "text": "话很多。感觉就像我身临其境一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15555.67, "timestamp": "04:19:15", "text": "幕后花絮之类的。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15557.67, "timestamp": "04:19:17", "text": "虽然它在背景里，但我感觉，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15559.349, "timestamp": "04:19:19", "text": "是的，我也得想出……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15563.03, "timestamp": "04:19:23", "text": "问题什么的，对吧？是的。但是它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15567.429, "timestamp": "04:19:27", "text": "说实话，感觉还不错。喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15569.429, "timestamp": "04:19:29", "text": "并不是每个人都那么健谈，对吧？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15576.944, "timestamp": "04:19:36", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "that great idea"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15577.149, "timestamp": "04:19:37", "text": "那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15582.71, "timestamp": "04:19:42", "text": "真的。在Spotify播客上创建一个频道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15585.99, "timestamp": "04:19:45", "text": "我以前想那样做，但现在不行。喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15588.95, "timestamp": "04:19:48", "text": "过了很久，连我自己都想开始了。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15589.127, "timestamp": "04:19:49", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "thats*"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15590.95, "timestamp": "04:19:50", "text": "我自己做了个播客，就像我一直想做的那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15594.63, "timestamp": "04:19:54", "text": "就像播客那种形式，但我想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15597.03, "timestamp